# Monorepo

- Layout: `apps/api` (BE), `apps/pms` (staff FE), `apps/web` (public FE). One API only.
- Product truth: `AGENTS.md` + `.docs/cabin-pms-client-plan.md`.
- Phase 1 = `api` + `pms`. Do not build `web` booking until Phase 2.
- No second backend. No OTA scraping / remote “Import now”. No Channel Manager in Phase 1.
- Inventory = unique units (one calendar each). Share via `packages/` only when two apps need it.
